<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - October 28.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - October 28.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Monday saw 4,244 fixed-interest five-year bonds maturing on February 12, 2000 trading at 91.4 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 4.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
